    "type": "game",
    "name": "Spearfishing Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3788200,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Spearfishing Simulator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very realistic Spearfishing simulator with a challenging gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a rookie spearo and learn spearfishing. Hunt fishes, earn money and experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new items to increase your hunting skills and diving performance. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your speargun, wetsuit, fins, mask and other items.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn XP while playing and increase your diving performance.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic fish behaviour.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item your equip, effects your diving and hunting performance.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic underwater sounds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various diving locations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target fish option. Hunt suggested target fish to earn x2 XP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game tips:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your experience(XP) points increase, you can hold your breath longer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since default gear is for snorkelling, it has a weak diving performance. Replace it when you earn money.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behave like you spearfishing in real life. Swimming towards the fish and chasing the fish won't work most of the time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade:</strong> Easy mode. Oxygen consumption is much more slower. Fishes are much more braver.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulation:</strong> Close to real life spearfishing. Oxygen level and consumption is very close to realistic mode, fishes can be spooked easily.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Realistic:</strong> This is for real spearfishers. Fishes are very sensitive to your movements. Try to stay calm and still while waiting the fish. Oxygen level and consumption is realistic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunting Log:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your catches are automatically saved into the Hunting Log, as a total quantity and weight for each fish species.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can later review these records from the Pause Menu.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Spearfishing Simulator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very realistic Spearfishing simulator with a challenging gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a rookie spearo and learn spearfishing. Hunt fishes, earn money and experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new items to increase your hunting skills and diving performance. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your speargun, wetsuit, fins, mask and other items.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn XP while playing and increase your diving performance.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic fish behaviour.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item your equip, effects your diving and hunting performance.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic underwater sounds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various diving locations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target fish option. Hunt suggested target fish to earn x2 XP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game tips:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your experience(XP) points increase, you can hold your breath longer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since default gear is for snorkelling, it has a weak diving performance. Replace it when you earn money.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behave like you spearfishing in real life. Swimming towards the fish and chasing the fish won't work most of the time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade:</strong> Easy mode. Oxygen consumption is much more slower. Fishes are much more braver.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulation:</strong> Close to real life spearfishing. Oxygen level and consumption is very close to realistic mode, fishes can be spooked easily.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Realistic:</strong> This is for real spearfishers. Fishes are very sensitive to your movements. Try to stay calm and still while waiting the fish. Oxygen level and consumption is realistic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunting Log:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your catches are automatically saved into the Hunting Log, as a total quantity and weight for each fish species.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can later review these records from the Pause Menu.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
